## Status

Self-excluded: **no verified public benchmark numbers** were found for the exact model/ID `gpt-5.2` in accessible sources at time of research.

## Research notes

- Verified metadata from accessible sources (not benchmark scores): Artificial Analysis lists GPT-5.2 (Xhigh) as a deprecated proprietary reasoning model (released 2025-12-11) with 400k context window, knowledge cutoff Aug 2025, text+image input, text output, and pricing around $1.75/$14.00 per 1M tokens in the fetched snapshot. OpenRouter lists `openai/gpt-5.2` with provider routing/pricing.
- Artificial Analysis reported Intelligence Index and task-level benchmark aggregates as unavailable/N/A in the fetched snapshot; no standalone verified benchmark scores (e.g. GPQA, SWE-bench, HLE, MMMU, Terminal-Bench, LiveCodeBench, etc.) for this exact model/ID were found in accessible sources.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`: if zero verified public benchmark numbers are found for the exact model/ID, save a notes-only `.md.excluded` file and do not invent placeholder scores.

